OL,3,GNEWSAWater main burst leaves hundreds
OL,4,Awithout supply
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of households are without
OL,7,Fwater or on low pressure, and a local
OL,8,Fprimary and pre-school have closed
OL,9,Fafter a water main burst.
OL,11,FModbury Primary and Pre-school, which
OL,12,Fhave about 200 pupils, are closed after
OL,13,Fthe burst was reported at about 11:00
OL,14,FBST.
OL,16,FSouth West Water said some customers in
OL,17,Fthe south Devon town, which has about
OL,18,F1,500 inhabitants, "may experience
OL,19,Flower water pressure than usual or a
OL,20,Floss of supply while we undertake
OL,21,Femergency repairs".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
